                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Pathfinder Adventure Path #225: Vaultlines"
            },
            "reset": "",
            "routine": "<p>The haunt makes a jaws Strike against each creature in the chamber as its first action. As its second action, it forces each creature hit by its jaws Strike to attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:34|options:inflicts:grabbed,inflicts:restrained] save. On a failure, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] until it [[/act escape dc=36]]{Escapes}. On a critical failure, or if the creature was already grabbed by the haunt, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] instead.</p>"
